[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25446.31, "timestamp": "07:04:06", "text": "900美元到1000美元简直疯了。不，我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25449.43, "timestamp": "07:04:09", "text": "至少要有500个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25452.628, "timestamp": "07:04:12", "text": "分期付款。不，这太荒谬了。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25455.91, "timestamp": "07:04:15", "text": "以破坏闻名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25458.23, "timestamp": "07:04:18", "text": "所以，目前我打算保留所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25461.35, "timestamp": "07:04:21", "text": "后面那些紧张的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25463.59, "timestamp": "07:04:23", "text": "暂时先用这个炉灶。我只是在做我该做的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25471.91, "timestamp": "07:04:31", "text": "刚刚经历了一段媒体封锁期"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25474.39, "timestamp": "07:04:34", "text": "一两年。我觉得我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25476.788, "timestamp": "07:04:36", "text": "想检查一下我的东西。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25479.83, "timestamp": "07:04:39", "text": "好的。好的。我们如何才能到达您的电机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25495.75, "timestamp": "07:04:55", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25498.948, "timestamp": "07:04:58", "text": "我当时在做什么？是的。"}]